  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "Brent G. Ingraham described the convergence of artificial intelligence, robotics, automation, and new manufacturing methods as enabled by technological revolutions. In a May 19, 2026 official statement, he said acquisition approaches in rapidly evolving domains such as AI must be condensed from years into months or weeks. He also said the PIT guides a startup with a game-changing AI prototype through every stage to transition from the lab to the battlefield, and that command-and-control efforts will focus on AI-enabled decision support, among other things.",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s2",
    "s3",
    "s4"
   ],
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Brent G. Ingraham described the convergence of artificial intelligence, robotics, automation, and new manufacturing methods as enabled by technological revolutions.",
     "sids": [
      "s1"
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "In a May 19, 2026 official statement, he said acquisition approaches in rapidly evolving domains such as AI must be condensed from years into months or weeks.",
     "sids": [
      "s2"
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "He also said the PIT guides a startup with a game-changing AI prototype through every stage to transition from the lab to the battlefield, and that command-and-control efforts will focus on AI-enabled decision support, among other things.",
